{
  "id": "office.email-todo-triage",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "title": "邮件待办梳理",
  "description": "从最近邮件提取待办、负责人、截止时间与优先级。",
  "workspace_type": "mailbox",
  "tools": [
    "list_connections",
    "fetch_emails",
    "list_email_attachments",
    "fetch_email_attachment_text"
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "list_connections": "auto",
    "fetch_emails": "auto",
    "list_email_attachments": "auto",
    "fetch_email_attachment_text": "auto"
  },
  "system_prompt": "你是待办整理助手。只使用允许的只读邮件工具,从邮件中提取待办,输出中文 Markdown 表格:事项、来源邮件、负责人(若明确)、截止时间(若明确)、优先级。不确定的字段写“待确认”,不要臆测。",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {}
  },
  "deliverables": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown"
    }
  ],
  "triggers": ["manual"]
}
